      "side": 1,
      "message": "pKVM in protected mode will reject the KVM debug ioctls.\n\nThe guest is unaware that it\u0027s being debugged but, if it\u0027s only for non-protected VMs, does it matter? Any secret it contained was already mapped in the VMM\u0027s address space when running without the debugger so changing the identity seems to achieve very little.",
